{%- if rb_part == 'glance' -%}
<p class="lead pdp__glance">Restore harmony to erratic, unpredictable skin. The Enchanted Garden utilizes balancing Geranium and precious Neroli to expertly stabilize combination skin and calm unexpected flare-ups. This therapeutic bar targets uneven oil production while reducing inflammation, paving the way for a serene, unified complexion.</p>
{%- else -%}
<div class="acc open">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="true">Description<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte">
    <h3>The Science and Targeted Therapeutic Benefits</h3>
    <p>The Enchanted Garden is a balancing and therapeutic bar formulated to stabilize erratic skin, soothe irritation, and promote an even, healthy complexion. The harmonious blend of geranium and neroli works beautifully for combination, stressed, or sensitive skin types by harmonizing both oil production and moisture levels.</p>
    <h3>Key Skin Benefits</h3>
    <ul>
                    <li>Hormonal &amp; Sebum Balance: Geranium oil naturally regulates oil glands, curbing excess shine without drying out the skin</li>
                    <li>Cellular Renewal: Neroli oil contains powerful cytophylactic properties that stimulate cellular turnover to fade acne scars</li>
                    <li>Redness &amp; Inflammation Relief: Anti-inflammatory compounds quickly calm irritated, blotchy, or weather-damaged skin surfaces</li>
                    <li>Pore Minimizing: The natural astringent properties of geranium gently tighten pores, refining overall skin texture</li>
                    <li>Skin Brightening: Neroli targets dullness and dark spots, leaving a subtle, clear radiance across the complexion</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>Ideal For:</strong> Combination, stressed, or sensitive skin.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="acc">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="false">Ingredients<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte"><p>Coconut Milk Base, Goats Milk, Rose Absolute Oil, Geranium Oil, Neroli Oil, Cedarwood Oil, Sandalwood Oil, Organic Patchouli Oil, Vetiver Oil, Organic Lavender Oil, Basil Oil, Amber Oil, Jasmine Oil, Warm Oud Oil, Organic Watermelon Seed Oil, Lime Oil, Organic Bergamot Oil, Natural Coloring, and Natural Preservative.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="acc">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="false">The Ritual<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte"><p>Use morning and night to balance oil zones and soothe irritation.</p></div>
</div>
{% render 'rb-acc-care' %}
<div class="acc">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="false">Storage / Safety Disclaimer<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte">
    <p><strong>Safety Disclaimer:</strong> For external use only. Avoid direct contact with eyes. In case of contact, rinse thoroughly with water. Discontinue use immediately if irritation, redness, or rash occurs. Consult a healthcare professional if irritation persists. Keep out of reach of children.</p>
    <p><strong>Aromatherapy &amp; Herbal Note:</strong> This product is hand-crafted with active botanicals, natural clays, and pure essential oils. We recommend performing a patch test on a small area of skin before your first full use. If you are pregnant, nursing, or under medical supervision, consult your physician before using bars containing high concentrations of essential oils.</p>
  </div>
</div>
{% render 'rb-acc-shipping' %}
{%- endif -%}
